export const homeHtml = "<div class=\"page-section active\" data-page=\"home\">\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"hero-grid\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Built for South Africa’s missing middle</span>\n<h1>Choosing what to study <span class=\"accent\">shouldn't</span> bankrupt your family.</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">You earn too much for NSFAS, too little for university to feel safe. Dharma Pathways gives you four free tools to weigh the real cost, the real risk, and the real fit of every post-school path — before you commit.</p>\n<div class=\"beta-notice\"><strong>Public beta:</strong> Dharma Pathways is being tested with South African families. Use it as decision support, then verify fees, admission rules, accreditation and funding directly before applying, borrowing or paying deposits.</div>\n<div class=\"hero-cta\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/tools/reality-check\">Start with a 2-minute Reality Check →</a>\n<a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/tools\">See all tools</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<aside class=\"hero-side\">\n<div class=\"hero-stat\">\n<div class=\"hero-stat-num\">10 families</div>\n<div class=\"hero-stat-label\">Tested with us before public launch — including the founders' own</div>\n<div class=\"hero-stat-source\">— see what they found below</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hero-stat\">\n<div class=\"hero-stat-num\">≈ R 350k+</div>\n<div class=\"hero-stat-label\">Realistic 3-year cost of public university: tuition, residence, food, transport, devices and data</div>\n<div class=\"hero-stat-source\">— Universities SA fee frameworks</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hero-stat\">\n<div class=\"hero-stat-num\">R 350,000–R 600,000</div>\n<div class=\"hero-stat-label\">The missing-middle income band — too high for NSFAS, too low to comfortably self-fund</div>\n<div class=\"hero-stat-source\">— DHET / NSFAS guidance</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"callout\">\n<div class=\"container container-narrow\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Why this exists</span>\n<h2>The advice you are given assumes you can either pay full price or qualify for full funding. Most families can do neither.</h2>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">If your household earns roughly R 350,000 to R 600,000 a year, you are caught in the gap. Bursary applications screen you out. Banks happily offer student loans you will struggle to repay. School counsellors steer everyone toward the same three universities. Meanwhile, no one tells you what an Honours actually costs once you add accommodation, data, and a working laptop — or that a TVET pathway might earn more, sooner, with less debt.</p>\n<p>Dharma Pathways was built to fill that gap with honest numbers and clear comparisons. No institution pays us. No referral fees. No hidden agenda.</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section style=\"background: var(--paper-deep);\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">How to use Dharma Pathways</span>\n<h2 style=\"max-width: 24ch;\">Start with the question you actually have.</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem;\">You do not need to understand the whole education system before using the site. Pick the entry point that sounds most like you.</p>\n<div class=\"journey-grid\">\n<div class=\"journey-card reveal\">\n<h3>I am a parent or guardian</h3>\n<p>You are probably asking whether the family can carry the cost without breaking the household.</p>\n<ul><li>Start with Reality Check.</li><li>Then run True Cost using the most likely option.</li><li>Print the final report before paying deposits.</li></ul>\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/tools/reality-check\">Start with affordability →</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"journey-card reveal\">\n<h3>I am a student</h3>\n<p>You may know what you like, but not whether the route is realistic, fundable or worth the risk.</p>\n<ul><li>Start with Career Fit.</li><li>Check readiness against your marks.</li><li>Compare a degree route against a safer alternative.</li></ul>\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/tools/fit-check\">Start with fit →</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"journey-card reveal\">\n<h3>I am from a school or NGO</h3>\n<p>Use the tools as a structured conversation guide with learners and families.</p>\n<ul><li>Use Reality Check for household context.</li><li>Use Route Compare for option counselling.</li><li>Use the final report as a take-home discussion sheet.</li></ul>\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/tools\">Open the toolkit →</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"trust-strip\">\n<div class=\"trust-item\"><strong>No login required</strong><span>Use the tools without creating an account or entering an ID number.</span></div>\n<div class=\"trust-item\"><strong>Private by default</strong><span>Your answers stay in your browser unless you choose to email them to us.</span></div>\n<div class=\"trust-item\"><strong>Independent</strong><span>No referral fees from universities, colleges, lenders or bursary providers.</span></div>\n<div class=\"trust-item\"><strong>Built for SA</strong><span>Missing-middle pressure, TVET routes, NSFAS thresholds and local pathway realities are built in.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Four tools, one decision</span>\n<h2 style=\"max-width: 18ch;\">A guided sequence — not another brochure.</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem;\">Each tool builds on the last. Use them in order for the strongest report, or jump to the question keeping you up at night.</p>\n<div class=\"tools-grid\">\n<a class=\"tool-card reveal\" href=\"/tools/reality-check\"><div class=\"tool-card-num\">— Step 01</div><h3>Reality Check</h3><p>How much pressure is your household actually under? A two-minute snapshot of income, dependents, and existing commitments.</p><span class=\"tool-card-arrow\">Take the check →</span></a>\n<a class=\"tool-card reveal\" href=\"/tools/cost-calculator\"><div class=\"tool-card-num\">— Step 02</div><h3>True Cost Calculator</h3><p>Tuition is rarely more than half the bill. Add accommodation, food, transport, devices, and data.</p><span class=\"tool-card-arrow\">Calculate the truth →</span></a>\n<a class=\"tool-card reveal\" href=\"/tools/route-compare\"><div class=\"tool-card-num\">— Step 03</div><h3>Route Compare</h3><p>Place two paths side-by-side and see which one is genuinely safer for your situation.</p><span class=\"tool-card-arrow\">Compare two routes →</span></a>\n<a class=\"tool-card reveal\" href=\"/tools/fit-check\"><div class=\"tool-card-num\">— Step 04</div><h3>Career Fit Check</h3><p>The cheapest path is worthless if it leads somewhere you will quit in two years.</p><span class=\"tool-card-arrow\">Find your fit →</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"early-users\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">What early users found</span>\n<h2 style=\"max-width: 22ch;\">Ten families. Five recurring moments of \"oh — we hadn't thought about that.\"</h2>\n<div class=\"early-users-disclosure\"><strong>Honest disclosure:</strong> Dharma Pathways was tested with ten South African families before public launch — including the founders' own families and close relatives. As we collect named feedback from public users, we will publish that too.</div>\n<div class=\"early-users-grid\">\n<div class=\"insight reveal\"><div class=\"insight-num\">— 01</div><p class=\"insight-quote\">\"The tools made hidden costs visible — food, housing, transport — not just tuition.\"</p><p class=\"insight-attr\">— recurring feedback from early users</p></div>\n<div class=\"insight reveal\"><div class=\"insight-num\">— 02</div><p class=\"insight-quote\">\"For the first time we saw what year one actually costs, beyond the fees on the brochure.\"</p><p class=\"insight-attr\">— recurring feedback from early users</p></div>\n<div class=\"insight reveal\"><div class=\"insight-num\">— 03</div><p class=\"insight-quote\">\"It showed us how unprepared we really were for our child starting university.\"</p><p class=\"insight-attr\">— recurring feedback from early users</p></div>\n<div class=\"insight reveal\"><div class=\"insight-num\">— 04</div><p class=\"insight-quote\">\"It surfaced the gap between what our child enjoys and what they think they should study.\"</p><p class=\"insight-attr\">— recurring feedback from early users</p></div>\n<div class=\"insight reveal\" style=\"grid-column: 1 / -1; max-width: 60ch;\"><div class=\"insight-num\">— 05</div><p class=\"insight-quote\">\"It let us put two completely different study options side-by-side and see the trade-off honestly.\"</p><p class=\"insight-attr\">— recurring feedback from early users</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section style=\"background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); padding: var(--space-12) 0;\">\n<div class=\"container container-narrow\">\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: var(--space-8); align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 6rem); font-weight: 400; color: var(--terracotta-soft); line-height: 1;\">51.7%</div>\n<div><p style=\"color: rgba(250,247,242,0.92); font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.4;\">of South African workers are in jobs that do not match their qualifications.</p><p style=\"color: rgba(250,247,242,0.6); font-size: 0.85rem; font-style: italic; margin: 0;\">— DHET 2024 National List of Occupations in High Demand</p></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"color: rgba(250,247,242,0.78); margin-top: var(--space-6); font-size: 1rem;\">A generation of South Africans studied something that did not lead where they hoped. Our tools cross-reference what you would thrive at against what the country actually needs.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: var(--space-6);\"><a href=\"/tools/next-steps\" style=\"color: var(--terracotta-soft); font-weight: 600;\">See the three-pathway recommendations engine →</a></p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section style=\"background: var(--paper-deep);\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">The Dharma method</span>\n<h2 style=\"max-width: 22ch;\">From \"I have no idea\" to \"I know exactly why I chose this.\"</h2>\n<div class=\"steps\">\n<div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"step-num\">— 01</div><h4>Honest inputs</h4><p>You tell us the real numbers. We do not pull credit data or ask for ID. Everything stays in your browser.</p></div>\n<div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"step-num\">— 02</div><h4>Transparent maths</h4><p>Every calculation is shown. No black-box scores. You can challenge any assumption we make.</p></div>\n<div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"step-num\">— 03</div><h4>Real comparisons</h4><p>Side-by-side, not feature-by-feature. We surface the trade-off you will actually feel.</p></div>\n<div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"step-num\">— 04</div><h4>A defensible decision</h4><p>You leave with a written summary you can show your family — and a path you understood before choosing.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section>\n<div class=\"container container-narrow\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">A note on independence</span>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1.75rem; max-width: 30ch; margin: 0 auto;\">We take no money from universities, colleges, lenders, or bursary providers.</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin: 1.5rem auto 2rem; text-align: left;\">Most \"free\" education advice in South Africa is paid for by the institutions you are being advised toward. Dharma Pathways is built independently and the tools are free to use.</p>\n<a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/about\">Read more about how we work</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"feedback-strip\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"feedback-grid\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Help us improve</span>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);\">Testing the tools? Tell us what confused you.</h2>\n<p style=\"margin-top: var(--space-4); max-width: 60ch;\">Dharma Pathways is still improving. We especially want to know which result felt unclear, which route you wished we covered, and whether any wording felt unfair or judgemental.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"feedback-actions\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"mailto:info@dharmapathways.org.za?subject=Dharma%20Pathways%20feedback\">Send feedback →</a>\n<a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"mailto:info@dharmapathways.org.za?subject=Report%20an%20error%20on%20Dharma%20Pathways\">Report an error</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>";

export const toolsHtml = "<div class=\"page-section active\" data-page=\"tools\">\n<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Free tools</span><h1>Four tools, in the order that matters — plus a recommendations engine that ties them together.</h1><p class=\"lead\">Start with whichever question is loudest right now — but the strongest decision comes from running all four in sequence.</p></div></section>\n<section style=\"padding-top: var(--space-12);\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"snapshot-panel\" id=\"pathwaySnapshot\"><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color: var(--terracotta-soft);\">Your Pathway Snapshot</span><h2 style=\"font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.35rem);\">Your current decision profile</h2><p>This snapshot updates as your household completes the tools. No tools completed yet? Start with Reality Check to build the first part of your snapshot.</p><div class=\"snapshot-grid\" id=\"snapshotGrid\"></div><div class=\"snapshot-action\" id=\"snapshotAction\"><strong>Recommended next action:</strong> Start with Reality Check to understand your household affordability pressure.</div></div><div class=\"tools-grid\" style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12);\">\n<a class=\"tool-card reveal\" href=\"/tools/reality-check\"><div class=\"tool-card-num\">— Step 01 · 2 minutes</div><h3>Reality Check</h3><p>How much pressure is your household actually under?</p><span class=\"tool-card-arrow\">Take the check →</span></a>\n<a class=\"tool-card reveal\" href=\"/tools/cost-calculator\"><div class=\"tool-card-num\">— Step 02 · 5 minutes</div><h3>True Cost Calculator</h3><p>See the real annual and monthly number you would actually need to find.</p><span class=\"tool-card-arrow\">Calculate the truth →</span></a>\n<a class=\"tool-card reveal\" href=\"/tools/route-compare\"><div class=\"tool-card-num\">— Step 03 · 5 minutes</div><h3>Route Compare</h3><p>University vs TVET, full-time vs distance, expensive vs affordable.</p><span class=\"tool-card-arrow\">Compare two routes →</span></a>\n<a class=\"tool-card reveal\" href=\"/tools/fit-check\"><div class=\"tool-card-num\">— Step 04 · 3 minutes</div><h3>Career Fit Check</h3><p>Map interests and working style to career fields where you are likely to thrive.</p><span class=\"tool-card-arrow\">Find your fit →</span></a>\n<a class=\"tool-card reveal\" href=\"/tools/next-steps\" style=\"grid-column: 1 / -1; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); border-color: var(--terracotta);\"><div class=\"tool-card-num\" style=\"color: var(--terracotta-soft);\">— After all four · 5 minutes</div><h3 style=\"color: var(--paper);\">What Comes Next — three pathways, three priorities</h3><p style=\"color: rgba(250,247,242,0.85);\">Cheapest, most employable, and fastest to earning — cross-referenced against South African labour-market signals.</p><span class=\"tool-card-arrow\" style=\"color: var(--terracotta-soft);\">See your pathways →</span></a>\n</div></div></section>\n</div>";

export const aboutHtml = "<div class=\"page-section active\" data-page=\"about\">\n<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">About</span><h1>Four people who lived the gap, built the tools they wish existed.</h1><p class=\"lead\">Dharma Pathways wasn't built by consultants who studied the problem — it was built by people who experienced it.</p></div></section>\n<section><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"two-col\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">The name</span><h2>Why \"Dharma\"?</h2></div><div><p><strong>Dharma</strong>, in the traditions it comes from, means the <em>right path</em> — not a single universal one, but the path that aligns with who you are, what you owe, and what you are built to carry.</p><p>Dharma Pathways exists to help each family find <em>their</em> right path — the one that works for their finances, their student, and their future.</p></div></div></div></section>\n<hr class=\"divider\"/>\n<section style=\"padding-top: 0;\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"two-col\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Mission</span><h2>What we are trying to do.</h2></div><div><p style=\"font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--ink);\">Help every South African family — especially those in the missing middle — make post-school education decisions with full information, honest maths, and zero conflicts of interest.</p><p>That means free tools that work without you signing up. Numbers that come from public, citable sources. Comparisons that include TVET, distance learning, work-then-study, and gap years with purpose.</p></div></div></div></section>\n<section style=\"background: var(--paper-deep);\"><div class=\"container\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">How we work</span><h2 style=\"max-width: 22ch;\">Six commitments we hold ourselves to.</h2><div class=\"value-grid\">\n<div class=\"value-item reveal\"><h4>Independence</h4><p>No payment from universities, colleges, lenders, or bursary providers.</p></div>\n<div class=\"value-item reveal\"><h4>Transparency</h4><p>Every formula and assumption used in our tools is documented.</p></div>\n<div class=\"value-item reveal\"><h4>Realism over optimism</h4><p>We default to honest, conservative numbers.</p></div>\n<div class=\"value-item reveal\"><h4>Range, not ranking</h4><p>We will not tell you which institution is better. We'll show trade-offs.</p></div>\n<div class=\"value-item reveal\"><h4>Privacy by default</h4><p>Tools run in your browser. We do not ask for ID or documents.</p></div>\n<div class=\"value-item reveal\"><h4>Local context</h4><p>NSFAS thresholds, SAQA levels, TVET reality — built in.</p></div>\n</div></div></section>\n<section><div class=\"container\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The team</span><h2 style=\"max-width: 26ch;\">Built by people who lived the problem.</h2><div class=\"team-grid\">\n<div class=\"team-card reveal\">\n<div class=\"team-card-role\">Executive Lead &amp; Founder</div>\n<h4>Shaylin Sing</h4>\n<p>Shaylin is the Supporter Relationship Manager at OUTA (Organisation Undoing Tax Abuse), where he manages a national call centre team and the organisation's supporter engagement function.</p>\n<p>He started Dharma Pathways because he fell through the missing middle gap himself. His parents earned too much for NSFAS and not enough for university to feel financially safe — and when he eventually studied, he chose the wrong field partly because he did not have access to the kind of honest, numbers-based guidance these tools try to provide.</p>\n<div class=\"lived-it\">\"I built the tools I wish existed when I was 18.\"</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"team-card reveal\">\n<div class=\"team-card-role\">Chairperson &amp; Chief Strategy Officer</div>\n<h4>Urvashi Dayanand</h4>\n<p>Urvashi is a Clinical Associate at DL Wineberg Inc., where she works alongside general and trauma surgeons in both surgical and administrative functions.</p>\n<p>She completed her BClinMedPrac (BCMP) at the University of Pretoria after not qualifying directly for medicine, on the understanding at the time that the degree would serve as a pathway into the medicine degree. During her first year, however, the university discontinued this transition — leaving her on a path shaped by advice that ultimately proved inaccurate, without access to tools to compare options or model alternative routes forward.</p>\n<p>This experience has shaped her commitment to supporting young people in making informed decisions about their post-school education. She is passionate about helping youth identify pathways that align with their goals and strengths, so they can move forward with clarity and confidence, and avoid the regret that can come from uninformed or misdirected choices.</p>\n<div class=\"lived-it\">\"If I'd had something like Route Compare, I might have found options I didn't know existed — and I would have known to check whether the programme was secure before committing.\"</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"team-card reveal\">\n<div class=\"team-card-role\">Director &amp; Chief Compliance Officer</div>\n<h4>Merissa Chetty</h4>\n<p>Merissa studied medicine at the University of KwaZulu-Natal and is currently completing her community service at Charlotte Maxeke Johannesburg Academic Hospital. She has a strong academic background and a keen interest in paediatrics.</p>\n<p>Through her journey, she has gained insight into the complexities of career pathways in South Africa, including the challenges of workforce planning and employment opportunities. She is passionate about helping students make informed, realistic decisions about their futures.</p>\n<div class=\"lived-it\">\"Brilliant marks and the wrong labour-market information can still leave you without a job. The system doesn't tell you that upfront.\"</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"team-card reveal\">\n<div class=\"team-card-role\">Director &amp; Chief Financial Officer</div>\n<h4>Keian Padayachee</h4>\n<p>Keian is a Chartered Accountant at Deloitte, with prior experience at KPMG. He is responsible for the financial integrity and modelling behind the tools.</p>\n<p>Keian was not personally affected by the missing middle gap in the same way as his co-founders. He came to Dharma Pathways because he watched the people around him — peers, family members, colleagues earlier in their careers — struggle not from lack of ability, but from a lack of good information at the decision point. That gap, he argues, is the same whether the family earns R 350,000 or R 600,000 a year.</p>\n<div class=\"lived-it\">\"It's not a skills problem. It's an information problem — and information problems are solvable.\"</div>\n</div>\n</div></div></section>\n</div>";

export const researchHtml = "<div class=\"page-section active\" data-page=\"research\">\n<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Research &amp; method</span><h1>Every formula. Every assumption. Every source.</h1><p class=\"lead\">If a tool gives you a number, you should be able to see why.</p></div></section>\n<section><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Frameworks we use</span><h2>The South African context, baked in.</h2>\n<div class=\"method-note\"><strong>Methodology review status:</strong><br/>Last methodology review: May 2026<br/>Next scheduled review: July 2026<br/><br/><strong>Data currency note:</strong> thresholds, fee ranges, funding rules and labour-market signals change. Each assumption should be re-checked before major public campaigns, school partnerships or paid advisory work. Users should verify all figures directly before applying or borrowing.</div>\n<div class=\"warning-box\" style=\"margin-top: var(--space-8);\"><strong>⚠ Damelin / Educor regulatory status — verify before applying</strong>In January 2026, DHET issued a Notice of Intent to Cancel Damelin’s private higher education registration. The Council on Higher Education has also recommended the withdrawal of Damelin qualifications from the HEQC register. These proceedings were ongoing as of May 2026. Users should verify current registration status directly with DHET, CHE and SAQA before applying, enrolling or paying deposits. Date checked: May 2026.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: var(--space-8);\">\n<h3>NSFAS household income threshold</h3><p>The Reality Check tool uses the publicly cited figure of R 350,000 combined annual household income as the eligibility cap. Verify the current threshold at nsfas.org.za before applying.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-8);\">Missing middle definition</h3><p>The missing middle is generally used for households earning between roughly R 350,000 and R 600,000 per year — too high for NSFAS, too low to comfortably self-fund.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-8);\">SAQA / NQF qualification levels</h3><p>Route Compare reflects the South African Qualifications Authority's NQF framework: Higher Certificate, Diploma, Bachelor’s, Honours, Master’s and Doctorate.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-8);\">DHET National List of Occupations in High Demand (OIHD)</h3><p>The 51.7% mismatch figure — South African workers in jobs not matching their qualifications — is drawn from the DHET 2024 OIHD publication. We use this as a labour-market signal in the What Comes Next recommendations engine. The 23% overqualification figure cited in our research is also drawn from the same document.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-8);\">CHE Vital Stats — undergraduate completion rates</h3><p>The approximately 50% undergraduate completion-within-5-years figure is drawn from CHE Vital Stats reports. It informs the repeat-year risk weighting in the True Cost Calculator and Route Compare tools.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-8);\">ICB — qualification deadline notice</h3><p>The Institute of Certified Bookkeepers' last enrolment date for NQF-registered qualifications in South Africa is 30 June 2026, after which enrolments will be under the IQB international framework only. This is noted in the Finance pathway card in the What Comes Next tool.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-8);\">Important limitation</h3><p>Cost figures are estimates. Specific institutions, residences, and cities can move them materially. Always verify fees directly before applying.</p>\n</div></div></section>\n<section style=\"background: var(--paper-deep);\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Reference list</span><h2>Where to verify our framing.</h2><p style=\"margin-top: var(--space-6);\">These links are starting points for verification, not endorsements. Before applying, borrowing or paying fees, confirm the current rule or figure directly with the relevant official body.</p><ul style=\"list-style: none; margin-top: var(--space-6); border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\">\n<li style=\"padding: var(--space-4) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\"><strong>NSFAS</strong> — household income thresholds and application process · <a href=\"https://www.nsfas.org.za\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">nsfas.org.za</a></li>\n<li style=\"padding: var(--space-4) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\"><strong>DHET</strong> — Missing Middle policy, TVET sector data, OIHD, and Damelin regulatory notices · <a href=\"https://www.dhet.gov.za\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">dhet.gov.za</a></li>\n<li style=\"padding: var(--space-4) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\"><strong>SAQA</strong> — qualification registry and NQF framework · <a href=\"https://www.saqa.org.za\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">saqa.org.za</a></li>\n<li style=\"padding: var(--space-4) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\"><strong>Stats SA</strong> — cost-of-living and household expenditure surveys · <a href=\"https://www.statssa.gov.za\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">statssa.gov.za</a></li>\n<li style=\"padding: var(--space-4) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\"><strong>CHE</strong> — Vital Stats reports on completion rates and Damelin HEQC proceedings · <a href=\"https://www.che.ac.za\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">che.ac.za</a></li>\n<li style=\"padding: var(--space-4) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\"><strong>Report a correction</strong> — found outdated data, a broken calculation or a missing pathway? · <a href=\"mailto:info@dharmapathways.org.za?subject=Dharma%20Pathways%20correction\">Email a correction</a></li>\n</ul></div></section>\n</div>";

export const privacyHtml = "<div class=\"page-section active\" data-page=\"privacy\">\n<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Privacy &amp; POPIA</span><h1>Plain-language privacy policy.</h1><p class=\"lead\">Most education sites collect more data than they admit. Dharma Pathways is designed to collect as little as possible.</p></div></section>\n<section><div class=\"container container-narrow\">\n<h3>The short version</h3><p>The Dharma Pathways tools run entirely in your browser. The numbers you enter are stored locally on your device and are not sent to us. Clearing your browser data clears them.</p><p>We do not sell data. We do not use behavioural advertising trackers. We do not require an account, email address, ID number, banking details or documents to use the free tools.</p>\n<hr class=\"divider\"/>\n<h3>What we collect</h3><ol style=\"padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.8;\"><li><strong>Tool inputs locally only:</strong> the information entered into the tools is saved to your browser's local storage so you can move between tools without re-entering everything. We cannot read this information unless you choose to send it to us yourself.</li><li><strong>Email correspondence:</strong> if you email us, we receive your email address and the contents of your message. We use this only to respond, keep a record of the query, and improve the public tools where appropriate.</li><li><strong>Basic analytics:</strong> we use Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand aggregate page visits and tool usage. This does not use cookies and does not identify individual users.</li></ol>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12);\">What we do not collect</h3><ul style=\"padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.8;\"><li>We do not ask for ID numbers, passport numbers, banking details or credit reports.</li><li>We do not require an account or login for the free tools.</li><li>We do not sell, rent or share user data with universities, colleges, lenders, bursary providers or advertisers.</li><li>We do not accept referral fees in exchange for recommending any education provider.</li></ul>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12);\">Your POPIA rights</h3><p>South Africa’s Protection of Personal Information Act gives you rights over personal information held about you. Because tool inputs stay on your own device, we do not hold that information. For email correspondence, you can request a copy of what we hold or ask us to delete it by emailing <a href=\"mailto:info@dharmapathways.org.za\">info@dharmapathways.org.za</a>.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12);\">Information Officer</h3><p>POPIA-related queries can be sent to <a href=\"mailto:info@dharmapathways.org.za\">info@dharmapathways.org.za</a>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12); color: var(--ink-mute); font-size: 0.9rem;\">Last updated: May 2026.</p>\n</div></section>\n</div>";

export const termsHtml = "<div class=\"page-section active\" data-page=\"terms\">\n<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Terms, disclaimers &amp; independence</span><h1>Use the tools as decision support — not as a guarantee.</h1><p class=\"lead\">Dharma Pathways helps families ask better questions, compare options more honestly, and prepare for real conversations. It does not replace professional advice or direct verification with institutions and funders.</p></div></section>\n<section><div class=\"container container-narrow\">\n<h3>1. Educational guidance only</h3><p>The tools and recommendations on Dharma Pathways are provided for general educational guidance. They are not personalised financial advice, legal advice, psychological advice, admission advice, funding advice, or a guarantee of any education, funding, employment or immigration outcome.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12);\">2. No guarantee of admission, funding or employment</h3><p>Admission requirements, funding rules, bursary deadlines, programme accreditation, institutional fees and labour-market conditions change. You must verify all information directly with the relevant university, TVET college, private provider, professional body, funder, government department or employer before making a commitment.</p>\n<div class=\"warning-box\" style=\"margin-top: var(--space-8);\"><strong>⚠ Damelin — specific warning</strong>As of January 2026, DHET issued a Notice of Intent to Cancel Damelin’s registration as a private higher education institution. The CHE has also recommended the withdrawal of Damelin qualifications. Dharma Pathways does not recommend Damelin as a destination. Do not enrol, apply or pay non-refundable deposits at Damelin without first confirming the current regulatory status directly with DHET and CHE.</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12);\">3. Cost and affordability estimates</h3><p>Cost figures are estimates only. They may be based on public fee ranges, typical student expenses, user inputs, or conservative assumptions. Actual costs can vary materially by institution, city, accommodation choice, transport distance, inflation, programme structure, repeat years, personal circumstances and funding outcomes.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12);\">4. Career and labour-market information</h3><p>Career-fit outputs and pathway recommendations are decision-support tools. They are not aptitude tests, psychometric assessments, employment guarantees, or formal career-counselling reports. Labour-market signals should be treated as one input among many, not as certainty.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12);\">5. Independence policy</h3><p>Dharma Pathways does not take referral fees from universities, colleges, lenders, bursary providers or training providers. We do not rank institutions based on payment. If this policy ever changes for any future service, it must be disclosed clearly before a user relies on the relevant information.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12);\">6. User responsibility</h3><p>You are responsible for checking all application requirements, deadlines, accreditation status, professional registration requirements, funding conditions, loan terms and total costs before making a decision. Use the tools to prepare better questions, not to skip due diligence.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12);\">7. Corrections and updates</h3><p>We aim to correct errors transparently. If you find outdated data, broken logic, a misleading statement, or a missing route, email <a href=\"mailto:info@dharmapathways.org.za?subject=Dharma%20Pathways%20correction\">info@dharmapathways.org.za</a> with the page name, the issue, and any source we should review.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12);\">8. Intellectual property</h3><p>The Dharma Pathways name, writing, tool logic, page structure, visual design and original content are protected as the project's intellectual property unless otherwise stated. Public sources remain the property of their respective owners.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12);\">9. Contact</h3><p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href=\"mailto:info@dharmapathways.org.za\">info@dharmapathways.org.za</a>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12); color: var(--ink-mute); font-size: 0.9rem;\">Last updated: May 2026.</p>\n</div></section>\n</div>";

export const contactHtml = "<div class=\"page-section active\" data-page=\"contact\">\n<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Contact</span><h1>Email is the best way to reach us.</h1><p class=\"lead\">A real person reads every message and replies as capacity allows.</p></div></section>\n<section style=\"padding-top: var(--space-12);\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\">\n<div class=\"form-section\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: var(--space-16) var(--space-8);\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Write to us at</span>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.4rem); margin: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-8); word-break: break-all;\"><a href=\"mailto:info@dharmapathways.org.za\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--terracotta); padding-bottom: 4px;\">info@dharmapathways.org.za</a></h2>\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"mailto:info@dharmapathways.org.za\">Open in your email app →</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-section\" style=\"margin-top: var(--space-8);\">\n<h3>Useful subject lines</h3>\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.9; margin-top: var(--space-4);\">\n<li><a href=\"mailto:info@dharmapathways.org.za?subject=Dharma%20Pathways%20feedback\">Tool feedback</a> — something felt confusing, harsh, unclear or useful.</li>\n<li><a href=\"mailto:info@dharmapathways.org.za?subject=Report%20an%20error%20on%20Dharma%20Pathways\">Report an error</a> — outdated figure, broken calculation or incorrect pathway.</li>\n<li><a href=\"mailto:info@dharmapathways.org.za?subject=Pathway%20request%20for%20Dharma%20Pathways\">Request a pathway</a> — a field, qualification or route you want us to add.</li>\n<li><a href=\"mailto:info@dharmapathways.org.za?subject=School%20or%20NGO%20Dharma%20Pathways%20query\">School / NGO query</a> — using the tools with learners or families.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></section>\n</div>";

export const reality_checkHtml = "<div class=\"page-section active\" data-page=\"reality-check\">\n<section class=\"tool-header\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><div class=\"progress\">Step 01 of 04 · <span>Reality Check</span></div><h1>How much pressure is your household actually under?</h1><p class=\"lead\">Answer honest questions. We'll give you a clear read on whether university-level commitments are comfortable, stretched, or risky.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tool-body\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><form id=\"rcForm\">\n<div class=\"form-section\"><h3>Income &amp; household</h3><p class=\"helper\">All numbers in South African Rand. Use take-home figures where possible.</p><div class=\"form-grid\">\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"income\">Monthly household take-home income <span class=\"label-helper\">all earners combined</span></label><div class=\"prefix-input\"><input id=\"income\" min=\"0\" placeholder=\"e.g. 35000\" required=\"\" step=\"500\" type=\"number\"/></div></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"dependents\">People supported by this income <span class=\"label-helper\">incl. yourself</span></label><input id=\"dependents\" max=\"15\" min=\"1\" placeholder=\"e.g. 4\" required=\"\" step=\"1\" type=\"number\"/></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"earners\">Number of income earners</label><input id=\"earners\" max=\"6\" min=\"1\" placeholder=\"e.g. 2\" required=\"\" step=\"1\" type=\"number\"/></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label>Income stability</label><div class=\"segmented\"><input checked=\"\" id=\"stableIncome\" name=\"incomeStability\" type=\"radio\" value=\"stable\"/><label for=\"stableIncome\">Stable</label><input id=\"variableIncome\" name=\"incomeStability\" type=\"radio\" value=\"variable\"/><label for=\"variableIncome\">Variable</label><input id=\"uncertainIncome\" name=\"incomeStability\" type=\"radio\" value=\"uncertain\"/><label for=\"uncertainIncome\">Uncertain</label></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"form-section\"><h3>Existing commitments</h3><p class=\"helper\">Roughly, what does your household already spend each month?</p><div class=\"form-grid\">\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"expenses\">Essential monthly expenses</label><div class=\"prefix-input\"><input id=\"expenses\" min=\"0\" placeholder=\"e.g. 22000\" required=\"\" step=\"500\" type=\"number\"/></div></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"debts\">Existing monthly debt repayments</label><div class=\"prefix-input\"><input id=\"debts\" min=\"0\" placeholder=\"e.g. 4500\" step=\"100\" type=\"number\"/></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"form-section\"><h3>The student’s situation</h3><p class=\"helper\">A few details that change which paths are realistic.</p>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label>Will the student need to live away from home?</label><div class=\"segmented\"><input checked=\"\" id=\"liveHome\" name=\"living\" type=\"radio\" value=\"home\"/><label for=\"liveHome\">Lives at home</label><input id=\"liveAway\" name=\"living\" type=\"radio\" value=\"away\"/><label for=\"liveAway\">Lives away</label><input id=\"liveUnsure\" name=\"living\" type=\"radio\" value=\"unsure\"/><label for=\"liveUnsure\">Not sure yet</label></div></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label>Other children expected to study in the next 5 years?</label><div class=\"segmented\"><input checked=\"\" id=\"sibNone\" name=\"siblings\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><label for=\"sibNone\">None</label><input id=\"sib1\" name=\"siblings\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><label for=\"sib1\">One</label><input id=\"sib2\" name=\"siblings\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><label for=\"sib2\">Two or more</label></div></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label>Can the student realistically work part-time while studying?</label><div class=\"segmented\"><input checked=\"\" id=\"workNo\" name=\"studentWork\" type=\"radio\" value=\"no\"/><label for=\"workNo\">No</label><input id=\"workMaybe\" name=\"studentWork\" type=\"radio\" value=\"maybe\"/><label for=\"workMaybe\">Maybe</label><input id=\"workYes\" name=\"studentWork\" type=\"radio\" value=\"yes\"/><label for=\"workYes\">Yes</label></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-section\"><h3>Household resilience</h3><p class=\"helper\">These answers help separate an on-paper surplus from real-life pressure.</p><div class=\"form-grid\">\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"emergencyMonths\">Emergency savings available</label><select id=\"emergencyMonths\"><option value=\"0\">Less than 1 month</option><option value=\"1\">About 1 month</option><option value=\"3\">2–3 months</option><option value=\"6\">More than 3 months</option></select></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label>Current credit pressure</label><div class=\"segmented\"><input checked=\"\" id=\"creditLow\" name=\"creditPressure\" type=\"radio\" value=\"low\"/><label for=\"creditLow\">Low</label><input id=\"creditMedium\" name=\"creditPressure\" type=\"radio\" value=\"medium\"/><label for=\"creditMedium\">Medium</label><input id=\"creditHigh\" name=\"creditPressure\" type=\"radio\" value=\"high\"/><label for=\"creditHigh\">High</label></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"form-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\">Show my reality check →</button><button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" type=\"reset\">Reset</button></div>\n</form>\n<div class=\"result-panel hidden\" id=\"rcResult\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color: var(--terracotta-soft);\">Your reality check</span>\n<div class=\"verdict\" id=\"rcVerdict\"></div>\n<p id=\"rcVerdictBody\"></p>\n<div class=\"stats\">\n<div><div class=\"stat-num\" id=\"rcAnnualIncome\"></div><div class=\"stat-label\">Annual household income</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"stat-num\" id=\"rcBracket\"></div><div class=\"stat-label\">Funding bracket</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"stat-num\" id=\"rcSurplus\"></div><div class=\"stat-label\">Monthly surplus before study</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"stat-num\" id=\"rcCapacity\"></div><div class=\"stat-label\">Realistic monthly study capacity</div></div>\n</div>\n<h4 style=\"margin-bottom: var(--space-3);\">What this means</h4>\n<ul id=\"rcImplications\"></ul>\n<div class=\"next-steps\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/tools/cost-calculator\">Next: True Cost Calculator →</a>\n<button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-adjust=\"rcForm\" data-result=\"rcResult\" type=\"button\">Adjust answers</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-print\" onclick=\"window.print();\" type=\"button\">Print / save as PDF</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></section>\n</div>";

export const cost_calculatorHtml = "<div class=\"page-section active\" data-page=\"cost-calculator\">\n<section class=\"tool-header\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><div class=\"progress\">Step 02 of 04 · <span>True Cost Calculator</span></div><h1>Tuition is rarely more than half the bill.</h1><p class=\"lead\">Add what families actually pay and see the real annual and monthly cost.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tool-body\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><form id=\"costForm\">\n<div class=\"form-section\"><h3>Pathway being costed</h3><p class=\"helper\">Choose a scenario to pre-fill realistic South African ranges. You can override every number.</p><div class=\"form-grid\">\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"pathwayType\">Pathway type</label><select id=\"pathwayType\"><option value=\"\">Select…</option><option value=\"uni-public-home\">Public university — living at home</option><option value=\"uni-public-res\">Public university — residence/digs</option><option value=\"uni-honours\">Public university — Honours/Postgrad</option><option value=\"uni-private\">Private university / college</option><option value=\"tvet-home\">TVET college — living at home</option><option value=\"tvet-away\">TVET college — living away</option><option value=\"online\">Online / distance learning</option><option value=\"trade\">Trade / apprenticeship programme</option><option value=\"bridging\">Bridging / foundation year</option><option value=\"other\">Other / custom</option></select></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"yearOfStudy\">Year of study</label><select id=\"yearOfStudy\"><option value=\"1\">First year</option><option value=\"2\">Second year</option><option value=\"3\">Third year</option><option value=\"later\">Later year</option></select></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"programmeYears\">Expected programme length</label><select id=\"programmeYears\"><option value=\"1\">1 year</option><option value=\"2\">2 years</option><option selected=\"\" value=\"3\">3 years</option><option value=\"4\">4 years</option><option value=\"5\">5 years</option><option value=\"6\">6 years</option></select></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"repeatRisk\">Repeat-year / delay risk</label><select id=\"repeatRisk\"><option value=\"0\">Low — assume minimum time</option><option value=\"0.25\">Moderate — add 25% of one year as risk buffer</option><option value=\"0.5\">High — add 50% of one year as risk buffer</option><option value=\"1\">Very high — model one extra year</option></select></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"form-section\"><h3>Annual costs</h3><p class=\"helper\">All in Rand, per academic year.</p><div class=\"form-grid\" id=\"costInputs\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"form-section\"><h3>Funding &amp; support</h3><p class=\"helper\">Anything that reduces what your household must find each month.</p><div class=\"form-grid\">\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"bursary\">Annual bursary / scholarship</label><div class=\"prefix-input\"><input id=\"bursary\" min=\"0\" placeholder=\"e.g. 0\" step=\"500\" type=\"number\"/></div></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"nsfas\">Annual NSFAS / loan funding</label><div class=\"prefix-input\"><input id=\"nsfas\" min=\"0\" placeholder=\"e.g. 0\" step=\"500\" type=\"number\"/></div></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"studentInc\">Student's own income <span class=\"label-helper\">per month</span></label><div class=\"prefix-input\"><input id=\"studentInc\" min=\"0\" placeholder=\"e.g. 0\" step=\"100\" type=\"number\"/></div></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"external\">Family/external monthly contribution</label><div class=\"prefix-input\"><input id=\"external\" min=\"0\" placeholder=\"e.g. 0\" step=\"100\" type=\"number\"/></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"form-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\">Calculate true cost →</button><button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" type=\"reset\">Reset</button></div>\n</form>\n<div class=\"result-panel hidden\" id=\"costResult\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color: var(--terracotta-soft);\">Your true cost</span>\n<div class=\"verdict\" id=\"costVerdict\"></div>\n<p id=\"costVerdictBody\"></p>\n<div class=\"stats\">\n<div><div class=\"stat-num\" id=\"totalAnnual\"></div><div class=\"stat-label\">Total annual cost</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"stat-num\" id=\"netAnnual\"></div><div class=\"stat-label\">After funding</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"stat-num\" id=\"netMonthly\"></div><div class=\"stat-label\">Required / month</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"stat-num\" id=\"tuitionShare\"></div><div class=\"stat-label\">Tuition as % of total</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"stat-num\" id=\"firstMonthCost\"></div><div class=\"stat-label\">Likely first-month cash need</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"stat-num\" id=\"programmeTotal\"></div><div class=\"stat-label\">Estimated full-programme exposure</div></div>\n</div>\n<h4 style=\"margin-bottom: var(--space-3);\">What this means</h4>\n<ul id=\"costImplications\"></ul>\n<div class=\"residence-risk\" id=\"costResidenceRisk\"></div>\n<div class=\"funding-guidance\" id=\"costFundingGuidance\"></div>\n<div class=\"next-steps\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/tools/route-compare\">Next: Compare two routes →</a>\n<button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-adjust=\"costForm\" data-result=\"costResult\" type=\"button\">Adjust answers</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-print\" onclick=\"window.print();\" type=\"button\">Print / save as PDF</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></section>\n</div>";

export const route_compareHtml = "<div class=\"page-section active\" data-page=\"route-compare\">\n<section class=\"tool-header\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"progress\">Step 03 of 04 · <span>Route Compare</span></div><h1>Two paths, side-by-side. Which one is actually safer for you?</h1><p class=\"lead\">Add two routes and see the trade-off in numbers, not opinions.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tool-body\"><div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"form-section\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--space-8);\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Route templates</span><h2 style=\"font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);\">Not sure what to compare? Start here.</h2><p class=\"helper\">Choose a common South African study comparison to pre-fill the Route Compare form. The estimates are conservative starting points — review and edit them before clicking compare.</p><div class=\"template-grid\" id=\"routeTemplateGrid\"></div><p class=\"template-note\">These templates are not recommendations. They are starting points to help families compare realistic trade-offs more quickly.</p></div>\n<form id=\"routeForm\">\n<div class=\"compare-grid\">\n<div class=\"compare-col option-a\"><h3>Option A</h3><div class=\"form-section\" id=\"routeA\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"compare-col option-b\"><h3>Option B</h3><div class=\"form-section\" id=\"routeB\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-actions\" style=\"justify-content: center;\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\">Compare these routes →</button><button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" type=\"reset\">Reset</button></div>\n</form>\n<div class=\"result-panel hidden\" id=\"routeResult\" style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12);\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color: var(--terracotta-soft);\">Comparison verdict</span>\n<div class=\"verdict\" id=\"routeVerdict\"></div>\n<p id=\"routeVerdictBody\"></p>\n<table class=\"compare-result-table\"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th id=\"thA\">Option A</th><th id=\"thB\">Option B</th><th>Edge</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"compareTbody\"></tbody></table>\n<h4 style=\"margin: var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-3);\">Things worth thinking about</h4>\n<ul id=\"routeImplications\"></ul>\n<div class=\"next-steps\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/tools/fit-check\">Next: Career Fit Check →</a>\n<button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-adjust=\"routeForm\" data-result=\"routeResult\" type=\"button\">Adjust answers</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-open-questions=\"\" type=\"button\">Questions to ask before applying</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-print\" onclick=\"window.print();\" type=\"button\">Print / save as PDF</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question-generator hidden\" data-question-generator=\"\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Institution check</span><h3>Questions to ask before applying</h3><p class=\"helper\">Generate a formal email template and a checklist you can use with a university, TVET college, private college, bursary office or training provider.</p><div class=\"form-grid\"><div class=\"form-group\"><label>Institution / provider name <span class=\"label-helper\">optional</span></label><input data-institution-name=\"\" placeholder=\"e.g. University of Johannesburg\" type=\"text\"/></div><div class=\"form-group\"><label>Programme / qualification name <span class=\"label-helper\">optional</span></label><input data-programme-name=\"\" placeholder=\"e.g. Diploma in IT\" type=\"text\"/></div></div><div class=\"form-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-generate-questions=\"\" type=\"button\">Generate template</button><button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-copy-questions=\"\" type=\"button\">Copy questions</button></div><div class=\"question-output hidden\" data-question-output=\"\"></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></section>\n</div>";

export const fit_checkHtml = "<div class=\"page-section active\" data-page=\"fit-check\">\n<section class=\"tool-header\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><div class=\"progress\">Step 04 of 04 · <span>Career Fit Check</span></div><h1>The cheapest path is worthless if you will quit it in two years.</h1><p class=\"lead\">A short profile of interests and working style, mapped to South African career fields.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tool-body\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\">\n<form id=\"fitForm\">\n<div class=\"form-section\"><h3>Your subjects &amp; marks</h3><p class=\"helper\">This is not a formal APS calculator. It is a readiness check to flag when a good-fit career may still need a safer entry route, bridging option or different qualification level.</p><div class=\"form-grid\">\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"mathMark\">Maths mark</label><select id=\"mathMark\"><option value=\"0\">Not taking Maths / unknown</option><option value=\"35\">30–39%</option><option value=\"45\">40–49%</option><option value=\"55\">50–59%</option><option value=\"65\">60–69%</option><option value=\"75\">70–79%</option><option value=\"85\">80%+</option></select></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"scienceMark\">Physical Sciences mark</label><select id=\"scienceMark\"><option value=\"0\">Not taking Physical Sciences / unknown</option><option value=\"35\">30–39%</option><option value=\"45\">40–49%</option><option value=\"55\">50–59%</option><option value=\"65\">60–69%</option><option value=\"75\">70–79%</option><option value=\"85\">80%+</option></select></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"englishMark\">English mark</label><select id=\"englishMark\"><option value=\"35\">30–39%</option><option value=\"45\">40–49%</option><option selected=\"\" value=\"55\">50–59%</option><option value=\"65\">60–69%</option><option value=\"75\">70–79%</option><option value=\"85\">80%+</option></select></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"accountingMark\">Accounting / Business mark</label><select id=\"accountingMark\"><option value=\"0\">Not taking / unknown</option><option value=\"35\">30–39%</option><option value=\"45\">40–49%</option><option value=\"55\">50–59%</option><option value=\"65\">60–69%</option><option value=\"75\">70–79%</option><option value=\"85\">80%+</option></select></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"lifeScienceMark\">Life Sciences mark</label><select id=\"lifeScienceMark\"><option value=\"0\">Not taking / unknown</option><option value=\"35\">30–39%</option><option value=\"45\">40–49%</option><option value=\"55\">50–59%</option><option value=\"65\">60–69%</option><option value=\"75\">70–79%</option><option value=\"85\">80%+</option></select></div>\n<div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"overallMark\">General average / overall strength</label><select id=\"overallMark\"><option value=\"35\">Mostly 30–39%</option><option value=\"45\">Mostly 40–49%</option><option selected=\"\" value=\"55\">Mostly 50–59%</option><option value=\"65\">Mostly 60–69%</option><option value=\"75\">Mostly 70–79%</option><option value=\"85\">Mostly 80%+</option></select></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"form-section\"><h3>Your interests</h3><p class=\"helper\">0 = really not me; 100 = yes, definitely me.</p><div id=\"interestSliders\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"form-section\"><h3>Working style</h3><p class=\"helper\">Each pair sits on a spectrum.</p><div id=\"styleSliders\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"form-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\">See career fit →</button><button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" type=\"reset\">Reset</button></div>\n</form>\n<div class=\"result-panel hidden\" id=\"fitResult\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color: var(--terracotta-soft);\">Your career fit</span>\n<div class=\"verdict\" id=\"fitVerdict\"></div>\n<p id=\"fitVerdictBody\"></p>\n<div class=\"career-list\" id=\"careerList\"></div><div class=\"readiness-plan hidden\" id=\"readinessPlan\"></div><div class=\"alternative-finder\" id=\"careerAlternativeFinder\"></div>\n<h4 style=\"margin: var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-3);\">A few honest notes</h4>\n<ul id=\"fitImplications\"></ul>\n<div class=\"next-steps\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/tools/next-steps\">See your three pathways →</a>\n<a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/tools/route-compare\">Or compare in detail</a>\n<button class=\"btn btn-print\" onclick=\"window.print();\" type=\"button\">Print / save as PDF</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></section>\n</div>";

export const next_stepsHtml = "<div class=\"page-section active\" data-page=\"next-steps\">\n<section class=\"tool-header\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><div class=\"progress\">After Step 04 · <span>What comes next</span></div><h1>Three pathways. Three priorities. One real decision.</h1><p class=\"lead\">For each of your top career fits, we surface three different routes: cheapest, most employable, and fastest.</p></div></section>\n<section style=\"background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); padding: var(--space-12) 0;\"><div class=\"container container-narrow\"><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: var(--space-8); align-items: center;\"><div style=\"font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5rem); font-weight: 400; color: var(--terracotta-soft); line-height: 1;\">51.7%</div><div><p style=\"color: rgba(250,247,242,0.92); font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">of South African workers are in jobs that do not match their qualifications.</p><p style=\"color: rgba(250,247,242,0.6); font-size: 0.85rem; font-style: italic; margin: 0;\">— DHET 2024 National List of Occupations in High Demand</p></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"tool-body\"><div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"hidden\" id=\"emptyState\"><div class=\"form-section\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: var(--space-16) var(--space-8);\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Run the Career Fit Check first</span><h2 style=\"max-width: 28ch; margin: var(--space-4) auto;\">We need to know what fits you before we can recommend routes.</h2><p style=\"max-width: 50ch; margin: 0 auto var(--space-8);\">Run the Career Fit Check and your top career matches will load here automatically.</p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/tools/fit-check\">Open the Career Fit Check →</a></div></div>\n<div class=\"hidden\" id=\"resultState\">\n<div class=\"form-section\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--space-12);\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Family decision report</span><h2 style=\"margin-bottom: var(--space-4);\">Your pathway summary</h2><p class=\"helper\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--space-6);\">Private — pulled from your browser's local storage, not a server. Print or save this page as a PDF before clearing browser data.</p><div id=\"contextSummary\" style=\"font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--ink-soft);\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"form-section\" id=\"reportWarnings\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--space-12);\"></div>\n<div id=\"recommendations\"></div>\n<div class=\"alternative-finder\" id=\"finalAlternativeFinder\"></div>\n<div class=\"residence-risk\" id=\"finalResidenceRisk\"></div>\n<div class=\"funding-guidance\" id=\"finalFundingGuidance\"></div>\n<div class=\"result-panel\" style=\"margin-top: var(--space-12);\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color: var(--terracotta-soft);\">Final family checklist</span>\n<div class=\"verdict\">No path is wrong. The right path is the one your family can carry to the end.</div>\n<p>What matters is that you saw the trade-offs before you committed. This page is a decision-support report, not a guarantee of admission, funding or employment.</p>\n<h4 style=\"margin: var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-3);\">Before committing, ask the institution or provider:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Is the qualification currently accredited and recognised on the relevant NQF or professional framework?</li>\n<li>What did last year’s students pay in total, including hidden costs?</li>\n<li>What percentage of graduates completed on time?</li>\n<li>What percentage found relevant work within 12 months?</li>\n<li>What happens financially if the student repeats a year or changes programme?</li>\n<li>Is workplace learning, practical training, articles, internship or professional registration required?</li>\n<li>What is the refund or cancellation policy if funding falls through?</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 style=\"margin: var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-3);\">Suggested next actions this week</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Save this report as a PDF and discuss it with the household decision-makers.</li>\n<li>Get official fee statements from at least two institutions or providers.</li>\n<li>Confirm accreditation and professional recognition from an official source.</li>\n<li>Apply for funding before paying non-refundable deposits where possible.</li>\n<li>Run Route Compare again using the two most realistic options.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"action-checklist\" id=\"commitChecklist\"><h4>Before you commit</h4><label><input data-checklist-item=\"save-report\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Save or print the report.</label><label><input data-checklist-item=\"fee-statement\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Get an official fee statement from the institution or provider.</label><label><input data-checklist-item=\"accreditation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Confirm accreditation / registration from an official source.</label><label><input data-checklist-item=\"funding-deadline\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Check the relevant funding, bursary or loan deadline.</label><label><input data-checklist-item=\"residence-deposit\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Ask about residence, deposit, registration and first-month costs.</label><label><input data-checklist-item=\"cheaper-route\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Compare at least one cheaper route.</label><label><input data-checklist-item=\"field-conversation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Speak to someone currently working in the field.</label><label><input data-checklist-item=\"employment-outcomes\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Ask about graduate employment outcomes.</label><label><input data-checklist-item=\"refund-policy\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Check the refund / cancellation policy.</label><label><input data-checklist-item=\"repeat-funding-risk\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Confirm what happens if the student repeats a year or funding falls through.</label><div class=\"checklist-progress\" id=\"commitChecklistProgress\">0 of 10 completed.</div></div>\n<div class=\"conversation-guide\"><h4>Family conversation guide</h4><p>This report should help the household have a calmer, more honest conversation. Use these questions before anyone applies, borrows money, pays deposits or commits to accommodation.</p><div class=\"conversation-grid\"><div class=\"conversation-card\"><h5>For parents / guardians</h5><ul><li>What can we safely afford every month without putting the household under pressure?</li><li>What are we not willing to borrow for?</li><li>What happens if the student repeats a subject, repeats a year or changes programme?</li><li>Can we still support other children or family obligations later?</li><li>Are we choosing this option because it is affordable, or because it feels prestigious?</li><li>What would make us pause before paying a deposit?</li></ul></div><div class=\"conversation-card\"><h5>For students</h5><ul><li>Do I understand the actual work in this field, not just the qualification name?</li><li>Would I still choose this path if it takes one year longer than planned?</li><li>Have I spoken to someone already studying or working in the field?</li><li>Am I choosing this path because of fit, pressure, prestige, fear or genuine interest?</li><li>What is my safer second option if my first choice does not work out?</li><li>What am I willing to do this month to test the route before committing?</li></ul></div></div><p style=\"margin-top: var(--space-6); color: rgba(250,247,242,0.72); font-size: 0.92rem;\">A good decision is not the one that looks impressive on paper. It is the one the family can carry, the student can complete, and the labour market can realistically reward.</p></div>\n<div class=\"next-steps\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-print\" onclick=\"window.print();\" type=\"button\">Print / save as PDF</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"copyFamilySummary\" type=\"button\">Copy family summary</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"shareWhatsAppSummary\" type=\"button\">Share on WhatsApp</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-open-questions=\"\" type=\"button\">Questions to ask before applying</button>\n<a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/tools/route-compare\">Compare two in detail →</a>\n<a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/terms\">Read terms</a>\n<a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/contact\">Email us your situation</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"share-status\" id=\"shareStatus\"></div>\n<div class=\"question-generator hidden\" data-question-generator=\"\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Institution check</span><h3>Questions to ask before applying</h3><p class=\"helper\">Generate a formal email template and a checklist you can use with a university, TVET college, private college, bursary office or training provider.</p><div class=\"form-grid\"><div class=\"form-group\"><label>Institution / provider name <span class=\"label-helper\">optional</span></label><input data-institution-name=\"\" placeholder=\"e.g. University of Johannesburg\" type=\"text\"/></div><div class=\"form-group\"><label>Programme / qualification name <span class=\"label-helper\">optional</span></label><input data-programme-name=\"\" placeholder=\"e.g. Diploma in IT\" type=\"text\"/></div></div><div class=\"form-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-generate-questions=\"\" type=\"button\">Generate template</button><button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-copy-questions=\"\" type=\"button\">Copy questions</button></div><div class=\"question-output hidden\" data-question-output=\"\"></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></section>\n</div>";
